        "id": 3513462
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-26T17:45:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean add this kind of node in rtk_power_signals.dtsi?\n/ {\n    named-gpios {\n        compatible \u003d \"named-gpios\";\n        en_s5_rails: en_s5_rails {\n            gpios \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiof 9 0\u003e;\n        };\n    };\n\n    en_s5_rails_node: en_s5_rails {\n        compatible \u003d \"intel,ap-pwrseq-gpio\";\n        gpios      \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiof 9 0\u003e;\n        output;\n    };\n};",
      "parentUuid": "fbb40645_45b02175",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 35,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 37,
        "endChar": 4
