      "writtenOn": "2025-05-26T18:30:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```\n/ {\n    named-gpios {\n        compatible \u003d \"named-gpios\";\n        en_s5_rails: en_s5_rails {\n            gpios \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiof 9 0\u003e;\n        };\n    };\n\n    en_s5_rails_node: en_s5_rails {\n        compatible \u003d \"intel,ap-pwrseq-gpio\";\n        gpios      \u003d \u003c\u0026gpiof 9 0\u003e;\n        output;\n    };\n};\n```",
      "parentUuid": "3033a13b_41a01c10",
