      "writtenOn": "2025-05-27T21:58:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just delete the sub-nodes I highlighted from rtk_gpio.dtsi.\n\nThe file rtk_power_signals.dtsi is fine as is, you don\u0027t need to add the nodes you delete from rtk_gpio.dtsi.\n\nrtk_power_signals.dtsi declares the GPIOs used by the AP power sequence driver.  Any GPIOs added to rtk_power_signals.dtsi do not need to be part of `named-gpios`.\n\nYou should also delete `#include \"../power_signals_gpios.dtsi\"` from the brkt/project.overlay file.  This should fix any compile problems for missing DTS node names.",
      "parentUuid": "9ed96927_358cc9b8",
      "range": {
